## Talking to the staging API

The staging service takes a bearer token. A decoded example of the shape it
expects, with a signature that verifies against nothing:

    eyJhbGciOiAiSFMyNTYiLCAidHlwIjogIkpXVCJ9..ZGVmYW5nZWQgZml4dHVyZSBzaWduYXR1cmUsIG5vdCBhIHJlYWwga2V5IGF0IGFsbA

Read the expiry claim before you retry a failed request.
